"本页介绍 `Erle-Brain <https://erlerobotics.com/blog/product/erle-brain/>`__ "
"Linux 飞控——一款将 ArduPilot 飞控与 :ref:`伴飞计算机 <dev:companion-computers>` 集成于一体的产品。"

